# --- Manim ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Manim's scratch workspace: every render writes here, including the
# partial-movie-files used for caching. Nothing in here is tracked.
#
# NOTE: `videos/` holds the curated low-quality previews and IS tracked on
# purpose (see videos/README.md), which is why *.mp4 is not ignored globally.
media/
*.webm
*.mov

